<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Chariot Holdings issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Chariot Holdings issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chariot Holdings Ltd, the new name for Harveys Curnow Ltd, on Friday advised shareholders to exercise caution in dealings as negotiations, which could affect its share price were continuing.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
